n western european country  and compare it with a southern one and  you should be able to make a couple of  sound generalizations about these  countries just by looking at the  differences between the north and south  of belgium like belgium the north of  europe is more dependent on services and  trade and has recently had a stronger  economy while the south is more  dependent on industry tourism and is  considered by some metrics economically  weaker being more likely to suffer from  economic shocks than its northern  counterparts  like belgium there is an important  difference which does matter between  roman and germanic culture and like  belgium where consensus literally takes  the longest on the planet the eu also  has extreme difficulty with balancing  european countries in order to get even  something close to uniminity  finally like belgium europe is also  uncertain about what it's going to do  with itself in the future  [Music]

